{# A single received webmention rendered as a reply/comment card. Called from
   partials/webmentions.njk for text-bearing mentions (replies + comments).

   Marked up as an h-cite (a citation of the external response) wrapping the
   author's h-card — the microformats-correct shape for a rendered received
   mention. NOTE: the date is a plain <time> with NO `dt-published` class: that
   mf2 property belongs to THIS site's posts (partials/date.njk), not to someone
   else's mention, so stamping it here would pollute the page's mf2 parse.

   `content.text` is rendered WITHOUT `| safe` so Nunjucks auto-escapes it — never
   trust a remote mention's HTML. Avatars are hotlinked plain <img> (webmention.io
   proxies them); the {% image %} shortcode is avoided on purpose — it breaks on
   remote URLs and is async, which the interlinker plugin would drop here. #}

<article id="webmention-{{ webmention['wm-id'] }}" class="webmention h-cite | flow">
  <div class="webmention__meta | cluster">
    {% if webmention.author and webmention.author.name %}
      <a
        class="webmention__author p-author h-card u-url no-indicator"
        href="{{ webmention.author.url or webmention.url }}"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >
        <img
          eleventy:ignore
          class="u-photo"
          src="{{ webmention.author.photo or (meta.webmentions.fallbackAvatar | url) }}"
          alt=""
          width="48"
          height="48"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <strong class="p-name">{{ webmention.author.name }}</strong>
      </a>
    {% else %}
      <strong class="webmention__author">Anonymous</strong>
    {% endif %}

    {% if webmention['wm-received'] %}
      <time class="webmention__date" datetime="{{ webmention['wm-received'] | toIsoString }}">
        {{ webmention['wm-received'] | formatDate('D MMM YYYY') }}
      </time>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <div class="webmention__text p-content">
    {{ webmention.content.text | truncate }}
  </div>

  {% if webmention.url %}
    <a class="webmention__source u-url" href="{{ webmention.url }}" rel="noopener noreferrer">Source</a>
  {% endif %}
</article>
